<title>USA: American Power stock falls after forecast.</title>
<headline>American Power stock falls after forecast.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in American Power Conversion Corp fell on Tuesday amid concerns that the company's revenue growth would not keep pace with its strong 1996 rate.</p>
<p>Late Monday, American Power said it expected its revenues to grow by 20 to 25 percent in 1997.</p>
<p>The forecast came after it reported fourth-quarter and full-year 1996 results that showed sales for the year rose 37 percent to $706.9 million from $515.3 million in 1995.</p>
</text>
